{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2019-11", "window": 3, "start_date": 1573862400, "end_date": 1574467199, "month_true_total": 9106, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:59:43 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "57663700", "author": {"steamid": "76561198261132816", "personaname": "Protonic", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198261132816/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 54604, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 16703, "last_played": 1593060335, "avatar": "b57622c3038c20c4378fd1f66ce1330c4b5d32fc"}, "language": "english", "review": "A ninja-sim ...in SPACE. Warframe has: multiple game modes, a variety of melee and ranged weapons, amazing graphics, and new Warframes ( player characters ) with different abilities seemingly every update. The only possible downside ( I can think of right now ) is that the game only has you fight 3 factions of enemies. There are a few types in each faction, but only one thing is consistent among them - you are their worst nightmare. Something I really like is the option to realistically farm for most of the items that catch your eye. Overall its a great game.", "timestamp_created": 1574467124, "timestamp_updated": 1574467124, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "57663482", "author": {"steamid": "76561198204737564", "personaname": "Syber", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fresh-smooth/", "num_games_owned": 55, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 37472, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 30245, "last_played": 1757485940, "avatar": "557cbbc9a5af57605deef7336f3b88ea6123159a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Quite good although a bit grindy", "timestamp_created": 1574466792, "timestamp_updated": 1574466792, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "57663056", "author": {"steamid": "76561198125575863", "personaname": "☠ MerethylAenwyn ☠", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/VargrOfMidgard/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 101195, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 61484, "last_played": 1767736789, "avatar": "4290f7c16da72a80387c7d44a72125a00ef2803e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I love the game, I think it is great..yeh it can be a bit of a grind, But that is why I love it!! You got to put the effort in. I guess it's not for everyone. I don't like everything been handed to me on a platter. My only issue is the fact that colour pallets are still locked behind Plat. Even if the amount of plat you needed for the colour pallets was lowered it would be better then it is now.", "timestamp_created": 1574466156, "timestamp_updated": 1574466156, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "57662984", "author": {"steamid": "76561198201917895", "personaname": "Randomsnorlax", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198201917895/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 27541, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 21510, "last_played": 1783477531, "avatar": "4826b5ff5ece23af491cf8a915564f56e41896e2"}, "language": "english", "review": "I really love this game. They update it relatively frequently and i love the gameplay and atmosphere. However I will admit the game is quite a bit of a grind. I enjoy that but be warned that if you don't there is quite a bit of it. At the start of the game some of the things are confusing but you will learn them as you get later in the game. For example the mod system is confusing at the beginning but you get it as you go.", "timestamp_created": 1574466058, "timestamp_updated": 1574466058, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "57662948", "author": {"steamid": "76561198172884629", "personaname": "tingus pingus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198172884629/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 37136, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13289, "last_played": 1756662257, "avatar": "db1df24457a46d97da681ddbce742de4d605ac95"}, "language": "english", "review": "hella good", "timestamp_created": 1574466000, "timestamp_updated": 1574466000, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}